{"id":"170713b2aedf2fd0","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-logic-algebraic-closure.md","title":"ZFC Logic Algebraic Closure","display":"df-zfc-logic-algebraic-closure — ZFC Logic Algebraic Closure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-logic-algebraic-closure","aliases":["58-df-zfc-logic-algebraic-closure"],"display":"df-zfc-logic-algebraic-closure — ZFC Logic Algebraic Closure","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[58-df-logic]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","[[./58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-logic-algebraic-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-logic-algebraic-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-logic-algebraic-closure — ZFC Logic Algebraic Closure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"44e32f3fb4334e0c\" href=\"?note=44e32f3fb4334e0c\" title=\"58-df-logic\">58-df-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"./58-df-formula.md\">58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> (first-order language) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\)</span> (an <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span>-structure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)\">\\(A\\subseteq\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)\\)</span> (parameter set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> (model-theoretic algebraic closure of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar a\\in\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\bar a\\in\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> (finite parameter tuple)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span> (structure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> (formula codes and their free variables)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak M,s)\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak M,s)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\\models\\varphi[s]\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\models\\varphi[s]\\)</span> (assignment and satisfaction)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> (finite-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TupleSat}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{TupleSat}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (tuple-satisfaction abbreviation defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLogicAlgebraicClosure}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogicAlgebraicClosure}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic\\text{-}tuple\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash \\mathrm{TupleSat}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L,\\varphi,b,\\bar a)\\leftrightarrow b\\in\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)\\land\\bar a\\in\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\land\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\bar a)+1\\}\\land\\exists s\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak M,s)\\land s(v_0)=b\\land\\forall i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\bar a)\\;(s(v_{i+1})=\\bar a(i))\\land\\mathfrak M\\models\\varphi[s]\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic\\text{-}tuple\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash \\mathrm{TupleSat}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L,\\varphi,b,\\bar a)\\leftrightarrow b\\in\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)\\land\\bar a\\in\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\land\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\bar a)+1\\}\\land\\exists s\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak M,s)\\land s(v_0)=b\\land\\forall i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\bar a)\\;(s(v_{i+1})=\\bar a(i))\\land\\mathfrak M\\models\\varphi[s]\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}closure}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLogicAlgebraicClosure}_S(C,A,\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L)\\land A\\subseteq\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)\\land C=\\Bigl\\{b\\in\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak M):\\exists\\bar a\\in A^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{TupleSat}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L,\\varphi,b,\\bar a)\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(\\{c\\in\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak M):\\mathrm{TupleSat}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L,\\varphi,c,\\bar a)\\})\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}closure}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLogicAlgebraicClosure}_S(C,A,\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L)\\land A\\subseteq\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)\\land C=\\Bigl\\{b\\in\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak M):\\exists\\bar a\\in A^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{TupleSat}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L,\\varphi,b,\\bar a)\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(\\{c\\in\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak M):\\mathrm{TupleSat}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L,\\varphi,c,\\bar a)\\})\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A parameter tuple is interpreted through a genuine assignment; formulas are taken from the unary repository family <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Algebraicity requires a satisfied formula whose solution set in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\)</span> is finite; it does not require that the formula isolate a unique element.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-logic","status":"resolved","id":"44e32f3fb4334e0c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"./58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[.